From 6642853e3e8808033a677eb391c5aa3f5337ec97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pointofpressure <pointofpressure@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:28:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] text: filter_display, a client filter of the text it
 shows

Text::resolved, which every draw and measure of a component goes through (HUD, menus, signs, tooltips),
hands its result to the installed filter; Font::width and the menus' own font (ui_theme's layout) ask
shown_str for plain strings, so width and drawing agree. Not applied while the filter itself runs.
Unset, it costs one load per text. display_changed tells the caches of shown text (the renderer's sign
text) that the filter's answers changed. For Streamer Mode-style name hiding everywhere text is shown.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
